	(text "(builds 1-25 aimed at -4.4 V, in dropout below 4.6 V in); 2 MHz, 250 mA. The bead and 10 µF keep the 2 MHz out of the op-amp rail"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 450.85 375.92 0)
		(effects
